note right of tenantFilter
  **Multi-Tenancy Enforcement:**
  - Extracts Host header
  - Resolves subdomain or custom domain
  - Populates TenantContext ThreadLocal
  - All downstream queries auto-filtered by tenant_id

  **Documentation:**
  - docs/adr/ADR-001-tenancy.md
end note

note right of checkoutOrchestrator
  **Checkout Flow:**
  1. Validate cart + inventory
  2. Validate shipping address
  3. Fetch shipping rates
  4. Calculate sales tax
  5. Apply loyalty discounts
  6. Create payment intent
  7. Reserve inventory
  8. Create order + shipment records
  9. Send confirmation email (async)

  **Transactional Boundaries:**
  - Single database transaction
  - Rollback on any step failure
  - Idempotency via cart token
end note

note right of stripeAdapter
  **Stripe Integration:**
  - Implements PaymentProvider interface
  - Connect for marketplace payouts
  - Webhook signature validation
  - Idempotency keys for retries
  - Handles payment intents, refunds, disputes

  **Consignment:**
  - Platform account for SaaS fees
  - Connected accounts per merchant
  - Application fee splits for consignors
end note

note right of mediaPipeline
  **Media Processing:**
  - Async job queue pattern
  - Pre-signed upload URLs
  - FFmpeg for video transcoding
  - Thumbnailator for image resizing
  - Generates WebP variants
  - Stores in Cloudflare R2
  - Updates media_assets table with URLs
end note

note right of reportingProjections
  **Event-Driven Reporting:**
  - Listens to domain events via CDI
  - Builds read-optimized aggregates
  - Time-series data for dashboards
  - Supports CSV/PDF export
  - Separate from transactional tables
  - Eventually consistent
end note

note right of jobScheduler
  **Background Job Model:**
  - Database-backed DelayedJob pattern
  - Priority queues (CRITICAL → BULK)
  - Exponential backoff retries
  - Dead letter queue
  - Cron-like schedules via @Scheduled
  - Separate worker pod deployment
end note

